		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ghastly undead created from the spirit of a heretical priest. During the daytime, appears as a mortal priest. At night, skeletal corpse.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 claw +2 (1d4 + rot), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Apostate Aura</strong>. Huecuva and all undead within near have ADV to resist turn undead.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rot</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
